Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 15:51:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/44] style: clang-format-15 sweep of files later touched by
 chexc

Mechanical, no semantic change. Concentrates the whole-file formatting
churn that cj.py's old fmt spread across every feature commit; the
feature commits that follow are pure semantic diffs against this.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/cangjie/Option/Option.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/cangjie/Option/Option.h b/include/cangjie/Option/Option.h
index d4c12ca9..96260c06 100644
--- a/include/cangjie/Option/Option.h
+++ b/include/cangjie/Option/Option.h
@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@
 #include "cangjie/Option/OptionTable.h"
 #include "cangjie/Utils/FileUtil.h"
 #include "cangjie/Utils/Utils.h"
-#include  "cangjie/Utils/Semaphore.h"
+#include "cangjie/Utils/Semaphore.h"
 
 namespace Cangjie {
 
